  "limitations": [
    "This provider-source-reviewed oracle catches missing grants only for actions named here; it does not infer undocumented provider behavior or unknown dependent actions.",
    "Condition satisfiability is outside this mapping and is protected only for the separately declared known traps.",
    "The resource-type census cannot detect a new configured field on an existing block; provider or module field changes require the documented source review.",
    "Provider probes whose denial is explicitly tolerated are excluded, including ELB capacity-reservation and deletion ENI reads and S3 tag APIs with a required legacy fallback.",
    "The aws.iam_lifecycle provider's configured trust-policy and permissions-boundary update paths are intentionally denied; elspeth-724e9cb5d5 tracks replacement-safe drift semantics.",
    "The disputed ec2:CreateNetworkInterface dependency of aws_efs_mount_target remains contingent on the least-privilege verification apply tracked by elspeth-acc2ce713b; it is not asserted or pre-granted."
  ],
